OL,3,AMeta agrees to pay up to $16.68bn to
OL,4,Asettle social media case
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media giant Meta has reached a
OL,7,Fsettlement with 29 US states to resolve
OL,8,Fa court case related to child safety on
OL,9,FFacebook and Instagram.
OL,11,FThe tech company will pay a maximum of
OL,12,F$16.68bn (#12.26bn), according to news
OL,13,Fagency Reuters.
OL,15,FThe court judgement requires Meta
OL,16,Fintroduce certain rules for teenage
OL,17,Fusers, including daily limits and
OL,18,Fnight-time blocks.
OL,20,FMeta denied wrongdoing in agreeing to
OL,21,Fsettle.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
